# Root repo: keep large generated logs out of git
tobyOS/qemu*.log
tobyOS/**/qemu*.log

# Prebuilt Bootlin glibc cross-toolchain used by the linux-* acceptance tests
# (~670 MB, downloaded by programs/linux-glibc/build.sh -- not a source artefact)
.glibc-tc/

# Stray nested build tree: tobyOS/tobyOS/ (~2.1 GB) is a SECOND copy of the
# build outputs -- disk.img (1.0 GB), tobyOS.iso (810 MB), the sata/nvme test
# images, tobyos.bin -- created by running a build from the wrong working
# directory (a relative path resolved one level too deep). It is not a source
# tree: it holds no .c/.h of its own, only generated artefacts and a few
# stale summary docs that already exist one level up.
#
# Ignored rather than deleted -- that is the user's call, not the build's.
# To reclaim the space: rm -rf tobyOS/tobyOS
tobyOS/tobyOS/
